- cloud/laya_train.py and src/verdict/train/items.py adapt the RLCD fine-tune notebook.
- src/verdict/judge/router.py vendors the question bank of laya.router_questions().

verdict runs Laya checkpoints through laya-mlx (https://github.com/mizorewww/laya-mlx,
Apache-2.0), an independent MLX port. The base checkpoints are downloaded from Hugging Face
(convaiinnovations/laya and aac6fef/laya-mlx); they are not included in this repository, and
neither are verdict's own fine-tuned weights.
